{%- liquid
  # Precomputed here (not inline in the <style> block below) because .cart__right's mobile color
  # scheme override needs to re-derive several CSS custom properties using the exact same formulas
  # as the global per-scheme block in snippets/css-variables.liquid - those formulas involve
  # multi-branch logic and a color_mix filter that read more clearly as their own assignments.
  assign mobile_scheme = section.settings.cart_summary_color_scheme_mobile

  assign mobile_subheading_has_background = true
  assign mobile_subheading_has_border = true

  if mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_background == blank or mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_background == 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' or mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_background == mobile_scheme.settings.background
    assign mobile_subheading_has_background = false
  endif

  if mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_border_color == blank or mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_border_color == 'rgba(0,0,0,0)'
    assign mobile_subheading_has_border = false
  endif

  if mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_hover_background != blank
    assign mobile_button_hover_background = mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_hover_background
  else
    assign mobile_button_hover_background = mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_background | color_darken: 12
  endif

  # Same background-match check snippets/css-variables.liquid uses to collapse padding between two
  # consecutive sections that share a background - used here to decide whether the mobile order
  # summary should go full-bleed (no point keeping a visible card boundary when its background is
  # identical to the section's own, since there's nothing to visually separate).
  assign main_scheme_background_hash = section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background_gradient | default: section.settings.color_scheme.settings.background | md5
  assign mobile_scheme_background_hash = mobile_scheme.settings.background_gradient | default: mobile_scheme.settings.background | md5
  assign mobile_scheme_matches_section_background = false

  if main_scheme_background_hash == mobile_scheme_background_hash
    assign mobile_scheme_matches_section_background = true
  endif
-%}

{%- capture mobile_border_color -%}
  {%- if settings.global_border_color != blank and settings.global_border_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
    {{- settings.global_border_color.rgb -}}
  {%- elsif mobile_scheme.settings.border_color != blank and mobile_scheme.settings.border_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
    {{- mobile_scheme.settings.border_color.rgb -}}
  {%- elsif mobile_scheme.settings.background_gradient != blank -%}
    {{- mobile_scheme.settings.text_color.rgb -}} / 0.1
  {%- elsif mobile_scheme.settings.background == 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
    {{- mobile_scheme.settings.text_color.rgb -}} / 0.6
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign mobile_border_color_mix = mobile_scheme.settings.text_color | color_mix: mobile_scheme.settings.background, 10 -%}
    {{- mobile_border_color_mix.rgb -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mobile_border_color = mobile_border_color | strip -%}

<style>
  {%- comment -%}
  Same interior padding as sections/libro-reclamaciones.liquid - container-gutter + 0.5rem on all
  four sides, same on mobile and desktop, top tripled - instead of the global "Section spacing"
  setting this section normally uses. Put directly on .section-spacing itself (not on the nested
  .container) so it's one plain padding: on one element, on top of whatever .container's own
  margin already does - same as every other floating section in the theme.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .section-spacing {
    padding: calc(var(--container-gutter) + 0.5rem);
    padding-block-start: calc((var(--container-gutter) + 0.5rem) * 3);
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  .container (nested inside .section-spacing) still carries its own margin-inline
  (--container-gutter-context) for the site-wide gutter - stacked on top of the padding above,
  that doubles up the left/right inset. Zeroing just the gutter part of that margin formula
  leaves .section-spacing's own padding as the only source of side space.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .section-spacing .container {
    --container-gutter-context: 0px;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  cart__right is now a solid color-scheme box (order summary card) instead of a bordered outline,
  so the 1px border theme.css gives it is no longer needed here.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .cart__right {
    border-width: 0;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  Product images inherit the order summary box's own corner radius (cart_summary_border_radius,
  set above) instead of a new independent value, so they stay in sync with it.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .line-item__media {
    border-radius: {{ section.settings.cart_summary_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  The sticky positioning is a desktop-only treatment (matches .cart's own 1000px breakpoint, where
  cart__right sits beside the items as a distinct column) - below that, it stacks under the items
  in normal flow instead, so sticky is neutralized back to static. It still keeps its own solid
  color-scheme card look on mobile, just from a separate, independently configurable color scheme
  (cart_summary_color_scheme_mobile) instead of cart_summary_color_scheme's desktop one.

  The color-scheme--[id] classes are generated once, globally, and aren't breakpoint-aware, so
  which one applies can't be swapped by viewport width through the class name alone - the only way
  to give this element a different scheme on mobile without JS is to re-declare the CSS custom
  properties it actually reads, scoped to this element and this media query, using
  cart_summary_color_scheme_mobile as the source. See the liquid block above this style tag for
  the values re-derived here (mirroring snippets/css-variables.liquid's per-scheme block).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  @media screen and (max-width: 999px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .cart__right {
      position: static;

      --accent: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_background.rgb }};
      --background: {% if mobile_scheme.settings.background == 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' %}0 0 0 / 0{% else %}{{ mobile_scheme.settings.background.rgb }}{% endif %};
      --background-gradient: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.background_gradient }};
      --text-color: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.text_color.rgb }};
      --border-color: {{ mobile_border_color }};
      --subheading-background: {% if mobile_subheading_has_background %}{{ mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_background.rgb }}{% else %}0 0 0 / 0.0{% endif %};
      --subheading-border: {% if mobile_subheading_has_border %}1px solid rgb({{ mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_border_color.rgb }}){% else %}none{% endif %};
      --subheading-text-color: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.subheading_text_color.rgb }};
      --subheading-has-padding: {% if mobile_subheading_has_border or mobile_subheading_has_background %}1{% else %}0{% endif %};
      --button-background-primary: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_background.rgb }};
      --button-text-primary: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.primary_button_text_color.rgb }};
      --button-hover-background: {{ mobile_button_hover_background.rgb }};
      --input-background: {% if mobile_scheme.settings.input_background == 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' %}0 0 0 / 0{% else %}{{ mobile_scheme.settings.input_background.rgb }}{% endif %};
      --input-text-color: {{ mobile_scheme.settings.input_text_color.rgb }};
      {%- if mobile_scheme.settings.input_border_color != blank and mobile_scheme.settings.input_border_color != 'rgba(0,0,0,0)' -%}
        --input-border-color: rgb({{ mobile_scheme.settings.input_border_color.rgb }});
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if mobile_scheme_matches_section_background -%}
        {%- comment -%}
        Cancels exactly .section-spacing's own inline padding (the only remaining inline inset
        between .cart__right and the outer section wrapper's edge - .container's gutter is already
        zeroed above and .max-w-2xl never constrains at mobile widths), so the card stretches flush
        to the section's own edges instead of floating inside it - there's no background contrast
        left to justify a visible card boundary once the two schemes share the same background.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        margin-inline: calc(-1 * (var(--container-gutter) + 0.5rem));
        padding-inline: 0;
      {%- endif -%}
    }
  }

  {%- comment -%}
  Line items no longer sit in a table with their own quantity/total columns, so restore the
  line-item component's own built-in quantity selector and price (theme.css hides these on
  desktop specifically because the old table layout duplicated them in separate columns).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .cart .line-item__quantity-selector,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .cart .line-item__line-price,
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .cart .line-item__unit-line-price {
      display: revert;
    }
  }
</style>

{%- comment -%}
No overflow: hidden on the floating wrapper here (unlike other floating sections that clip a
full-bleed background image/video): this section has no such background, and .cart__right is
position: sticky - any overflow other than visible on an ancestor breaks that stickiness. The
corner radius below still rounds the box's own background fine without it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="color-scheme color-scheme--{{ section.settings.color_scheme.id }}{% if section.settings.floating_cart %} section-floating section-floating--block-end{% endif %}"{% if section.settings.floating_cart %} style="border-end-start-radius: {{ section.settings.cart_border_radius }}px; border-end-end-radius: {{ section.settings.cart_border_radius }}px;"{% endif %}>
  <div class="section-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      {%- if cart.empty? -%}
          <div class="empty-state">
            <div class="prose prose-justify-center">
              <h1 class="h3">{{ 'cart.general.title' | t }}</h1>
              <p>{{ 'cart.general.empty' | t }}</p>

              {%- assign button_content = 'cart.general.continue_shopping' | t -%}
              {%- render 'button', content: button_content, href: settings.cart_empty_cart_link -%}
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="v-stack gap-6 sm:gap-12">
            <div class="cart">
              <div class="cart__left">
                <div class="v-stack gap-6 sm:gap-8">
                  <h1 class="h3">{{ 'cart.general.title' | t }}</h1>

                  {%- comment -%}
                  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                  ORDER SUMMARY
                  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  {%- form 'cart', cart, id: 'cart-main-form', class: 'cart-form' -%}
                    <div class="v-stack gap-6">
                      {%- for line_item in cart.items -%}
                        {%- render 'line-item', line_item: line_item, show_line_price: true, hide_unit_price: true, show_quantity_selector: true -%}
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </div>
                  {%- endform -%}
                </div>

                {%- comment -%}
                ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                SHIPPING ESTIMATOR
                ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                {%- endcomment -%}

                {%- if section.settings.show_shipping_estimator and cart.requires_shipping -%}
                  {%- assign accordion_title = 'cart.shipping_estimator.estimate_shipping' | t -%}
                  {%- capture accordion_content -%}{%- render 'shipping-estimator' -%}{%- endcapture -%}

                  {%- render 'accordion', title: accordion_title, content: accordion_content, icon: 'shipping-estimator', icon_width: 12, large: true -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>

              <div class="cart__right color-scheme color-scheme--{{ section.settings.cart_summary_color_scheme.id }}" style="border-radius: {{ section.settings.cart_summary_border_radius }}px;">
                <div class="v-stack gap-4 sm:gap-5">
                  <div class="v-stack gap-2">
                    <span class="subheading">{{ 'cart.general.item_count' | t: count: cart.item_count }}</span>

                    {%- if settings.cart_show_free_shipping_bar -%}
                      {%- render 'free-shipping-bar' -%}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </div>

                  {%- render 'input', name: 'attributes[dni_ruc_ce]', label: 'DNI / RUC / CE', placeholder: 'DNI / RUC / CE', value: cart.attributes['dni_ruc_ce'], form: 'cart-main-form' -%}

                  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
                    {%- case block.type -%}
                      {%- when '@app' -%}
                        {%- render block -%}

                      {%- when 'totals' -%}
                        <div class="v-stack gap-4" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                          {%- if section.settings.allow_discount_application or cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
                            <div class="v-stack gap-2">
                              {%- if section.settings.allow_discount_application -%}
                                {%- render 'cart-discount' -%}
                              {%- endif -%}

                              {%- if cart.cart_level_discount_applications.size > 0 -%}
                                <div class="h-stack gap-2">
                                  {%- for discount_application in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
                                    <div class="discount-badge text-xxs">
                                      {%- render 'icon' with 'discount', width: 12 -%} {{ discount_application.title }} (-{{ discount_application.total_allocated_amount | money }})

                                      {%- if section.settings.allow_discount_application and discount_application.type != '' -%}
                                        <cart-discount-remove-button discount-code="{{ discount_application.title | escape }}" class="h-stack align-center">
                                          <button type="button">{%- render 'icon' with 'close', width: 8 -%}</button>
                                        </cart-discount-remove-button>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                    </div>
                                  {%- endfor -%}
                                </div>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </div>
                          {%- endif -%}

                          <div class="v-stack gap-1.5">
                            {%- if block.settings.show_order_weight -%}
                              <div class="h-stack justify-between gap-4">
                                <span>{{ 'cart.general.weight' | t }}</span>
                                <span>{{ cart.total_weight | weight_with_unit }}</span>
                              </div>
                            {%- endif -%}

                            <div class="h-stack justify-between gap-4">
                              <span>{{ 'cart.general.subtotal' | t }}</span>
                              <span>
                                {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
                                  {{- cart.items_subtotal_price | money_with_currency -}}
                                {%- else -%}
                                  {{- cart.items_subtotal_price | money -}}
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </span>
                            </div>

                            <div class="h-stack justify-between gap-4">
                              <span class="medium">{{ 'cart.general.total' | t }}</span>
                              <span class="medium">{{- cart.total_price | money_with_currency -}}</span>
                            </div>

                            {%- if block.settings.show_shipping_text -%}
                              {%- liquid
                                if cart.taxes_included and shop.shipping_policy.body != blank
                                  assign shipping_text = 'cart.general.taxes_included_and_shipping_policy_html' | t: link: shop.shipping_policy.url
                                elsif cart.taxes_included
                                  assign shipping_text = 'cart.general.taxes_included_but_shipping_at_checkout' | t
                                elsif shop.shipping_policy.body != blank
                                  assign shipping_text = 'cart.general.taxes_and_shipping_policy_at_checkout_html' | t: link: shop.shipping_policy.url
                                else
                                  assign shipping_text = 'cart.general.taxes_and_shipping_at_checkout' | t
                                endif
                              -%}
                      
                              <p class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ shipping_text }}</p>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </div>
                        </div>

                      {%- when 'cart_note' -%}
                        <cart-note class="cart-note" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                          {%- assign order_note = 'cart.general.order_note' | t -%}
                          {%- render 'input', name: 'note', multiline: 4, label: order_note, value: cart.note, form: 'cart-main-form' -%}
                        </cart-note>

                      {%- when 'text' -%}
                        {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                          <div class="prose" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                            {{- block.settings.text -}}
                          </div>
                        {%- endif -%}

                      {%- when 'accelerated_buttons' -%}
                        {% if additional_checkout_buttons %}
                          <div class="additional-checkout-buttons additional-checkout-buttons--vertical" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                            {{- content_for_additional_checkout_buttons -}}
                          </div>
                        {% endif %}

                      {%- when 'checkout_button' -%}
                        {%- assign checkout_button = 'cart.general.checkout' | t -%}
                        {%- render 'button', type: 'submit', content: checkout_button, name: 'checkout', stretch: true, form: 'cart-main-form', block: block -%}

                      {%- when 'terms_of_service' -%}
                        <div class="checkbox-control">
                          <input id="main-cart-terms-of-service" type="checkbox" class="checkbox" required form="cart-main-form" value="1">
          
                          {%- if shop.terms_of_service == blank -%}
                            <label for="main-cart-terms-of-service">{{ 'cart.general.terms_of_services_checkbox' | t }}</label>
                          {%- else -%}
                            <label for="main-cart-terms-of-service">{{ 'cart.general.terms_of_services_checkbox_with_link_html' | t: link: shop.terms_of_service.url }}</label>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        </div>

                      {%- when 'payment_methods' -%}
                        {%- if shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
                          <div class="v-stack justify-items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="subheading text-subdued">{{ 'cart.general.we_accept' | t }}</span>
        
                            <ul class="h-stack gap-2 unstyled-list">
                              {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
                                <li>{{- type | payment_type_svg_tag -}}</li>
                              {%- endfor -%}
                            </ul>
                          </div>
                        {%- endif -%}
                    {%- endcase -%}
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.main_cart.name",
  "class": "shopify-section--main-cart",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:global.colors.scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "floating_cart",
      "label": "Floating Cart",
      "info": "Adds margins around the cart (bottom and sides), using the store's global side margin.",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "cart_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Corner radius",
      "default": 0,
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.floating_cart }}"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "allow_discount_application",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_drawer.allow_discount_application",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_shipping_estimator",
      "label": "t:sections.main_cart.show_shipping_estimator",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "cart_summary_color_scheme",
      "label": "Order summary color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "cart_summary_color_scheme_mobile",
      "label": "Order summary color scheme (mobile)",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "cart_summary_border_radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 30,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Order summary corner radius",
      "default": 16
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "@app"
    },
    {
      "type": "totals",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.totals.name",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_order_weight",
          "label": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.totals.show_order_weight",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_shipping_text",
          "label": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.totals.show_shipping_text",
          "default": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "cart_note",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.cart_note.name",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "open_by_default",
          "label": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.cart_note.open_by_default",
          "default": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.text.name",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "t:global.text.text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkout_button",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.checkout_button.name",
      "limit": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "accelerated_buttons",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.accelerated_buttons.name",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.accelerated_buttons.configure_paragraph"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "terms_of_service",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.terms_of_service.name",
      "limit": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "payment_methods",
      "name": "t:sections.main_cart.blocks.payment_methods.name",
      "limit": 1
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
